      "type": "position",
      "label": "Headquarters",
      "notes": [
        {
          "text": "Home base on top. A successful pass was associated with a 99.6% win probability across 1,089 adult black-belt matches. Build the game around getting ONE clean pass. If they pull guard first, enter here immediately and start passing - no separate decision needed.",
          "createdAt": "2026-07-12T21:19:39.060Z"
